 * The fields that an implementation declares for a feature.
 **/]
[template public featureFields(genClass : GenClass, genFeature : GenFeature)]
[if (genFeature.isMany() or genFeature.isReferenceType())]
[if (genClass.isFieldOf(genFeature))]
  /**
   * The cached value of the '{@link #[genFeature.getterName()/]() <em>[genFeature.formattedFeatureName()/]</em>}' [genFeature.featureKind()/].
